#: ../../agents/trae.rst:4
msgid "Trae"
msgstr "Trae"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:6
msgid ""
"Trae is the AI integrated development environment of ByteDance, and Trae "
"CN is its edition for China. Trae has no plugin package format that a "
"repository can provide. ANet is therefore connected to Trae through three"
" extension points of Trae: an MCP server, two skills and two commands. A "
"bundle carries them, and the installer of the bundle installs it: "
"``install.sh`` on Linux and macOS, ``install.cmd`` on Windows. After the "
"installation, a Trae session has the tools of ``anet mcp`` (see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`): it finds agents on the network (``list_agents``,"
" ``get_agent_card``), delegates a task and collects the result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, ``cancel_task``), lists "
"tasks (``list_tasks``), answers tasks that other agents sent to the node "
"(``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pays or declines a quote within "
"the limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), reads the local evidence chain (``audit``) and reports "
"the state of the node (``node_status``)."
msgstr ""
"Trae 是字节跳动的 AI 集成开发环境，Trae CN 是其面向中国大陆的版本。Trae 没有可由代码仓库提供的插件包格式。因此，ANet "
"通过 Trae 的三种扩展点接入 Trae：一个 MCP "
"服务器、两个技能和两条命令。这些内容由一个安装包承载，并由安装包的安装程序安装：Linux 和 macOS 上为 "
"``install.sh``，Windows 上为 ``install.cmd``。安装完成后，Trae 会话即可使用 ``anet mcp`` "
"的工具（参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`）：查找网络中的 "
"agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``），委托任务并收取结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``），列出任务（``list_tasks``），答复其他"
" agent "
"发往本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``），在节点限额内支付或拒绝报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``），读取本地证据链（``audit``），并报告节点状态（``node_status``）。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:21
msgid ""
"The bundle is the only supported route for Trae: ``anet agents wire`` "
"does not register Trae."
msgstr "该安装包是 Trae 唯一受支持的接入方式：``anet agents wire`` 不会登记 Trae。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:29
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:31
msgid ""
"Trae or Trae CN with support for MCP servers, skills and commands. The "
"Trae documentation states no minimum version, and the steps on this page "
"have not been run in the application (see `Not tested`_)."
msgstr ""
"支持 MCP 服务器、技能和命令的 Trae 或 Trae CN。Trae 文档未给出最低版本，且本页所述步骤尚未在该应用中运行（参见 "
"`未经测试`_\\ ）。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:34
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ANet and the bundle run on Linux, macOS and Windows "
"(amd64 and arm64). On Linux and macOS the bundle runs POSIX shell "
"scripts; on Windows it runs ``.cmd`` scripts and Windows PowerShell 5.1, "
"which is part of Windows."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。ANet 和该安装包可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows（amd64 与 arm64）上运行。在 Linux 和 macOS"
" 上，安装包运行 POSIX shell 脚本；在 Windows 上，安装包运行 ``.cmd`` 脚本和 Windows 自带的 "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:38
msgid "The bundle, from one of two sources:"
msgstr "安装包，来源有以下两种："

