#: ../../agents/trae.rst:64 ../../agents/trae.rst:70
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:65
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` of the installed ``anet`` for the selected identity. On"
" Linux and macOS, Trae starts ``anet/bin/anet-mcp.sh`` as ``/bin/sh "
"<script>``; on Windows, it starts ``anet/bin/anet-mcp.cmd``. Its tool "
"``guide`` returns the current guide to ANet."
msgstr ""
"为所选身份运行已安装 ``anet`` 的 ``anet mcp``。在 Linux 和 macOS 上，Trae 以 ``/bin/sh "
"<script>`` 启动 ``anet/bin/anet-mcp.sh``；在 Windows 上，Trae 启动 ``anet/bin"
"/anet-mcp.cmd``。其工具 ``guide`` 返回 ANet 的最新指南。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:69 ../../agents/trae.rst:74
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:71
msgid ""
"Directs the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet`` before the first"
" ANet action of a session and on every ``@anet`` request, and holds the "
"rules that always apply."
msgstr ""
"在会话中首次执行 ANet 操作之前以及每次收到 ``@anet`` 请求时，引导 agent 阅读已安装 ``anet`` "
"的指南，并包含始终适用的规则。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:75
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:76
msgid ""
"Finds the ``anet`` executable, installs ANet when it is missing and the "
"user agrees, and follows the setup guide of the installed ``anet``."
msgstr "查找 ``anet`` 可执行文件，在其缺失且用户同意时安装 ANet，并按已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南执行。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:78 ../../agents/trae.rst:83
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:79
msgid "``/anet``"
msgstr "``/anet``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:80
msgid ""
"The entry point: carries out an ``@anet`` request as the guide describes."
" Without a request, it shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node"
" and the state of the node."
msgstr "入口：按指南所述执行 ``@anet`` 请求。未给出请求时，显示其他 agent 发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:84
msgid "``/anet-status``"
msgstr "``/anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:85
msgid "Reports the state of the node as the guide describes."
msgstr "按指南所述报告节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:87
msgid ""
"The bundle has the version 0.2.0. It carries no list of tools, no ANet "
"version and no setup steps. The installed ``anet`` provides them through "
"the MCP tool ``guide`` and the command ``anet guide [<topic>]``, so a new"
" release of ANet reaches Trae with the executable alone and the bundle "
"needs no update."
msgstr ""
"该安装包的版本为 0.2.0。安装包不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤，这些内容由已安装的 ``anet`` 通过 MCP 工具 "
"``guide`` 和命令 ``anet guide [<topic>]`` 提供。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭可执行文件即可作用于 "
"Trae，安装包无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:92
msgid ""
"The bundle has no hooks and opens no network connection. The node "
"connects to the hub it has joined. The installer helper of the bundle, "
"``anet/bin/anet-install.sh`` on Linux and macOS or ``anet/bin/anet-"
"install.cmd`` on Windows, runs the official installer of "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn`` when the user agrees."
msgstr ""
"安装包不含 Hook，也不建立任何网络连接。节点连接其加入的 hub。安装包的安装辅助脚本（Linux 和 macOS 上为 ``anet/bin"
"/anet-install.sh``，Windows 上为 ``anet/bin/anet-install.cmd``）在用户同意后运行 "
"``agentnetwork.org.cn`` 的官方安装程序。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:98
msgid ""
"Every ``anet`` command of the bundle runs through the runner of the "
"bundle, ``anet/bin/anet-run.sh`` on Linux and macOS and ``anet/bin/anet-"
"run.cmd`` on Windows, which applies the two settings described under "
"`Settings`_: the MCP server, the commands and the skills reach the same "
"executable and the same identity. Without the setting ``anetPath``, the "
"runner looks for ``anet`` in the absolute directories of ``PATH``, then "
"in ``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on "
"Linux and macOS, or in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on "
"Windows, because a desktop application does not always receive the "
"``PATH`` of the login shell. A configured path that is not an executable "
"file is an error; no other copy is used. When ``anet`` is not found, or "
"no daemon runs for the selected identity, the server exits with a one-"
"line reason, and the session has no anet tools. The shell of the agent on"
" Windows is PowerShell, so the skills and the commands name the Windows "
"runner as a path that PowerShell starts with ``&``."
msgstr ""
"安装包的每条 ``anet`` 命令都经由安装包的运行脚本执行（Linux 和 macOS 上为 ``anet/bin/anet-"
"run.sh``，Windows 上为 ``anet/bin/anet-run.cmd``），运行脚本应用 `设置项`_ 中所述的两项设置：MCP"
" 服务器、各命令与各技能使用同一可执行文件和同一身份。未设置 ``anetPath`` 时，运行脚本先在 ``PATH`` 的绝对路径目录中查找 "
"``anet``，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows 上依次查找 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``，因为桌面应用不一定继承登录 shell 的 "
"``PATH``。若所配置的路径不是可执行文件，则视为错误，不会改用其他副本。找不到 "
"``anet``，或所选身份没有运行中的守护进程时，服务器退出并给出一行原因，会话中不会出现 anet 工具。agent 在 Windows "
"上使用的 shell 是 PowerShell，因此各技能和命令把 Windows 运行脚本写成由 PowerShell 以 ``&`` "
"启动的路径。"

