msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:118
msgid "On Linux and macOS, run the script ``install.sh`` of the bundle:"
msgstr "在 Linux 和 macOS 上，运行安装包中的脚本 ``install.sh``："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:126
msgid ""
"On Windows, run ``install.cmd`` of the bundle in ``cmd`` or PowerShell. "
"It starts ``install.ps1`` with Windows PowerShell 5.1 from "
"``%SystemRoot%\\System32``, which is part of Windows:"
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，在 ``cmd`` 或 PowerShell 中运行安装包中的 ``install.cmd``。它以 "
"``%SystemRoot%\\System32`` 中 Windows 自带的 Windows PowerShell 5.1 启动 "
"``install.ps1``："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:136
msgid ""
"The options of ``install.cmd`` are ``-Project DIR``, ``-Cn``, ``-Identity"
" NAME``, ``-ClearIdentity``, ``-Anet PATH``, ``-ClearAnet`` and "
"``-Remove``; ``install.cmd -Help`` describes them."
msgstr ""
"``install.cmd`` 的选项为 ``-Project DIR``、``-Cn``、``-Identity "
"NAME``、``-ClearIdentity``、``-Anet PATH``、``-ClearAnet`` 和 "
"``-Remove``；``install.cmd -Help`` 给出其说明。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:140
msgid ""
"The installer copies the skills, the commands, the runners and the "
"launchers of the MCP server into the configuration directory, writes the "
"file ``anet/settings``, prints the MCP configuration, and starts no "
"process. It does not read or edit any configuration file of Trae. It "
"creates one file of Trae: the file ``.trae/mcp.json`` of a project, when "
"the project has none; an existing file is left unchanged. It refuses to "
"replace a skill or a command of the same name that it did not install. "
"Trae documents that the command of an MCP server must not contain spaces."
" On Linux and macOS, ``install.sh`` therefore refuses a home directory "
"whose path contains a space; on Windows, ``install.cmd`` replaces a path "
"with a space by its short (8.3) form, and refuses it when the volume "
"provides none."
msgstr ""
"安装程序把技能、命令、运行脚本和 MCP 服务器的启动脚本复制到配置目录，写入文件 ``anet/settings``，输出 MCP "
"配置，并且不启动任何进程。它不读取也不修改 Trae 的任何配置文件。它只创建 Trae 的一个文件：项目尚无 "
"``.trae/mcp.json`` 时，创建该项目的此文件；已有的文件保持不变。对于同名但并非由它安装的技能或命令，它拒绝替换。Trae "
"的文档规定 MCP 服务器的命令不得包含空格。因此，在 Linux 和 macOS 上，主目录路径含空格时 ``install.sh`` "
"拒绝安装；在 Windows 上，``install.cmd`` 以短路径（8.3 格式）替换含空格的路径，所在卷不提供短路径时则拒绝安装。"

