#: ../../agents/trae.rst:247
msgid ""
"It runs the runner with ``--resolve``, which reports the executable, the "
"version and the identity, or ``not found``. When ``anet`` is missing, it "
"states what the installer does and runs it only after the user agrees, "
"through ``anet/bin/anet-install.sh`` on Linux and macOS or ``anet/bin"
"/anet-install.cmd`` on Windows. The official installer verifies the "
"signed release manifest, installs into a directory of the user and "
"creates the identity with the safe defaults: inbound tasks closed, "
"nothing published, spending limits 0."
msgstr ""
"它以 ``--resolve`` 运行运行脚本，报告可执行文件、版本和身份，或报告 ``not found``。``anet`` "
"缺失时，它先说明安装程序的作用，并仅在用户同意后运行：Linux 和 macOS 上经由 ``anet/bin/anet-"
"install.sh``，Windows 上经由 ``anet/bin/anet-"
"install.cmd``。官方安装程序校验已签名的发布清单，安装到用户自己的目录，并按安全默认值创建身份：入站任务关闭、不发布任何内容、支出限额为"
" 0。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:255
msgid ""
"It prints the setup guide of the installed ``anet`` with ``<runner> guide"
" setup`` and follows it through the runner. When the hub admits by AID, "
"or has used up its sign-ups for the day, the registration stays pending; "
"the agent gives the user the line for the hub operator and does not act "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"它用 ``<runner> guide setup`` 输出已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南，并经由运行脚本按其执行。hub 按 AID "
"准入，或当日注册名额已用完时，注册保持待处理；agent 把需交给 hub 运营方的那一行提供给用户，并且不据此采取行动。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:261
msgid ""
"The commands that change who may reach the machine or what it may spend "
"(``anet peers``, ``anet inbound``, ``anet autoreply set``, the spending "
"limits and ``anet pay``) confirm on a terminal. The skills tell the agent"
" to name them and leave them to the user. The skills also tell the agent "
"not to read ``~/.anet`` and not to read or edit the configuration of "
"Trae."
msgstr ""
"更改谁可以访问本机或本机可支出多少的命令（\\ ``anet peers``\\ 、\\ ``anet inbound``\\ 、\\ "
"``anet autoreply set``\\ 、支出限额以及 ``anet pay``\\ ）需在终端确认。技能要求 agent "
"仅指明这些命令，并交由用户执行。技能还要求 agent 不读取 ``~/.anet``\\ ，也不读取或修改 Trae 的配置。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:267
msgid "Start a new session after the setup, so that the MCP server starts."
msgstr "配置完成后请开启新会话，使 MCP 服务器启动。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:271
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:273
msgid ""
"In a new session, run ``/anet-status``. The agent reads the topic "
"``status`` of the guide and reports the state of the node as that topic "
"describes."
msgstr "在新会话中运行 ``/anet-status``。agent 阅读指南的主题 ``status``，并按该主题所述报告节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:276
msgid ""
"Ask for a task with ``/anet`` or with a request that begins with "
"``@anet``, for example:"
msgstr "使用 ``/anet`` 或以 ``@anet`` 开头的请求提出任务，例如："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:285
msgid ""
"The agent reads the guide and calls the tools that it names, for example "
"``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card`` and ``send_message``, and "
"``wait_task`` when the task is still working. The report names the state "
"of the task (``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``) and ``anet.effect_status`` as the "
"tools returned them."
msgstr ""
"agent 阅读指南，并调用指南所指明的工具，例如 ``list_agents``、``get_agent_card`` 和 "
"``send_message``，任务仍在进行时再调用 "
"``wait_task``。报告按工具返回的内容给出任务状态（``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED``）和 "
"``anet.effect_status``。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:291
msgid "On a shell, the runner shows what the bundle selects:"
msgstr "在 shell 中，运行脚本可显示安装包所选定的内容："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:301
msgid ""
"On Windows, the same check is ``& \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.trae\\anet\\bin"
"\\anet-run.cmd\" --resolve`` in PowerShell."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，相同的检查是在 PowerShell 中运行 ``& "
"\"$env:USERPROFILE\\.trae\\anet\\bin\\anet-run.cmd\" --resolve``。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:305
msgid ""
"The steps in the list above were run with an earlier version of the "
"bundle and a stand-in for Trae, not with Trae. `Not tested`_ states what "
"that leaves open."
msgstr "上述列表中的步骤是用安装包的较早版本和 Trae 的替代程序运行的，并非在 Trae 中运行。其遗留的未决事项见 `未经测试`_。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:311
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:313
msgid ""
"The bundle has two optional settings, given to the installer (the options"
" of ``install.cmd`` in parentheses):"
msgstr "安装包有两个可选设置项，通过安装程序给出（括号中为 ``install.cmd`` 的选项）："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:320
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:321
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:322
msgid "``--identity NAME`` (``-Identity NAME``)"
msgstr "``--identity NAME``\\ （``-Identity NAME``）"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:323
msgid ""
"A named identity (``anet id ls``). ``--identity ''`` (``-ClearIdentity``)"
" selects the default identity again. The server then runs ``anet --id "
"<name> mcp``."
msgstr ""
"具名身份（``anet id ls``）。``--identity ''``\\ "
"（``-ClearIdentity``）将重新选用默认身份。服务器随后运行 ``anet --id <name> mcp``。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:326
msgid "``--anet PATH`` (``-Anet PATH``)"
msgstr "``--anet PATH``\\ （``-Anet PATH``）"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:327
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable (``anet.exe`` on Windows). "
"``--anet ''`` (``-ClearAnet``) searches the locations named above again. "
"A path that is not an executable file is an error; no other copy is used."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``）。``--anet ''``\\ "
"（``-ClearAnet``）将重新在上述位置中查找。若路径不是可执行文件，则视为错误，不会改用其他副本。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:332
msgid ""
"An option that is not given keeps the value of the earlier installation. "
"The installer keeps the values in two places. The file ``anet/settings`` "
"is read by the runner for the shell commands of the agent. The ``env`` of"
" the MCP entry (``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` and ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``) is read"
" by the launcher. The installer does not rewrite an existing "
"``.trae/mcp.json``, and at the user level it only prints the entry. After"
" a change, edit the ``env`` of the registered entry to match, and start a"
" new session. Otherwise the shell commands and the MCP server can use "
"different identities."
msgstr ""
"未给出的选项沿用先前安装的值。安装程序把这些值保存在两处：文件 ``anet/settings`` 由运行脚本读取，用于 agent 的 "
"shell 命令；MCP 条目的 ``env``\\ （``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 和 "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN``）由启动脚本读取。安装程序不会改写已有的 "
"``.trae/mcp.json``，用户级则只输出条目。更改后，请让已登记条目的 ``env`` 与之保持一致，并开启新会话；否则 shell "
"命令与 MCP 服务器可能使用不同的身份。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:343
msgid "Updating and removing"
msgstr "更新与移除"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:345
msgid ""
"Version 0.2.0 is the final version of the bundle; a new release of ANet "
"needs no new bundle. To replace an earlier version, run the installer of "
"version 0.2.0 again with the same scope. The installer is idempotent. "
"``anet update`` updates ANet itself, independently of the bundle."
msgstr ""
"0.2.0 是该安装包的最终版本；ANet 发布新版本时无需新的安装包。如需替换较早的版本，请以相同范围再次运行 0.2.0 "
"版本的安装程序。安装程序是幂等的。``anet update`` 更新 ANet 本身，与安装包相互独立。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:354
msgid ""
"On Windows, ``install.cmd -Remove`` removes the bundle, with ``-Cn`` or "
"``-Project DIR`` as installed. The command deletes the files that the "
"installer wrote and nothing else, and leaves no empty directory that it "
"created. Delete the MCP server ``anet`` from Trae, or the member ``anet``"
" of ``.trae/mcp.json``, and start a new session. Removal does not change "
"the node: the identity in ``~/.anet`` and the running daemon remain. "
":doc:`../intro/install` describes how to stop the node and remove ANet."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，``install.cmd -Remove`` 移除安装包，并按安装时的情况附加 ``-Cn`` 或 ``-Project"
" DIR``。该命令仅删除安装程序写入的文件，不删除其他内容，也不会留下由它创建的空目录。请从 Trae 中删除 MCP 服务器 "
"``anet``，或删除 ``.trae/mcp.json`` 中的成员 ``anet``，并开启新会话。移除不会改变节点：``~/.anet``"
" 中的身份和运行中的守护进程均保持不变。停止节点和移除 ANet 的方法见 :doc:`../intro/install`。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:364
msgid "Not tested"
msgstr "未经测试"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:366
msgid ""
"Trae is a graphical application without a command line or a headless "
"mode, and it was not run. The steps on this page were run on Linux with a"
" stand-in: a program that loads the skills from ``.trae/skills``, expands"
" the command file, starts the MCP server from ``.trae/mcp.json`` with the"
" arguments and the reduced ``PATH`` that the Trae documentation "
"describes, and gives a language model a shell tool. The stand-in is not "
"Trae. The following are therefore unverified:"
msgstr ""
"Trae 是没有命令行和无头模式的图形应用，本页并未在其中运行。本页步骤是在 Linux 上借助一个替代程序运行的：该程序从 "
"``.trae/skills`` 加载技能，展开命令文件，按 Trae 文档所述的参数和精简的 ``PATH`` 从 "
"``.trae/mcp.json`` 启动 MCP 服务器，并为语言模型提供 shell 工具。该替代程序并非 Trae。因此以下事项尚未验证："

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:374
msgid ""
"That Trae or Trae CN loads skills from ``~/.trae/skills``, ``~/.trae-"
"cn/skills`` and ``.trae/skills``, and commands from the corresponding "
"``commands`` directories."
msgstr ""
"Trae 或 Trae CN 是否从 ``~/.trae/skills``\\ 、\\ ``~/.trae-cn/skills`` 和 "
"``.trae/skills`` 加载技能，并从相应的 ``commands`` 目录加载命令。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:377
msgid ""
"Whether Trae accepts the ``description`` front matter of the command "
"files, and under which names it lists ``/anet`` and ``/anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"Trae 是否接受命令文件中的 ``description`` 前置元数据，以及它以何种名称列出 ``/anet`` 和 ``/anet-"
"status``。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:379
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"That Trae expands ``${workspaceFolder}`` in ``args`` and starts ``/bin/sh"
" <script>``; that **Project MCP** has to be turned on in the settings for"
" a project entry; and the location of the global MCP file."
msgstr ""
"Trae 是否展开 ``args`` 中的 ``${workspaceFolder}`` 并启动 ``/bin/sh <script>``\\ "
"；项目条目是否需要在设置中开启 **Project MCP**\\ ；以及全局 MCP 文件的位置。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:382
msgid ""
"The registration of the printed entry through **Settings**, **MCP**, "
"**Add**, **Create Manually**, and through the install link, and the "
"install link scheme of Trae CN."
msgstr ""
"通过 **Settings**\\ 、\\ **MCP**\\ 、\\ **Add**\\ 、\\ **Create Manually** "
"以及通过安装链接登记所输出条目的过程，以及 Trae CN 的安装链接方案。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:385
msgid "The environment of the graphical application, in particular its ``PATH``."
msgstr "图形应用的运行环境，尤其是其 ``PATH``\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:386
msgid ""
"The behaviour of a client that reads tool schemas strictly. The property "
"``accept`` of the tool ``submit_payment`` has no ``type``. The open-"
"source ByteDance program ``trae-agent``, which is a different program "
"from Trae, rejects it. Whether Trae accepts it is unknown."
msgstr ""
"严格解析工具模式的客户端的行为。工具 ``submit_payment`` 的属性 ``accept`` 没有 ``type``\\ "
"。开源的字节跳动程序 ``trae-agent``\\ （与 Trae 是不同的程序）会拒绝该属性。Trae 是否接受尚不明确。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:390
msgid "macOS. ``install.sh`` was run on Linux with ``dash``, ``bash`` and ``sh``."
msgstr "macOS。\\ ``install.sh`` 仅在 Linux 上以 ``dash``\\ 、\\ ``bash`` 和 ``sh`` 运行过。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:391
msgid ""
"Windows. ``install.cmd`` and the Windows runner are tested with "
"PowerShell. Whether Trae starts a ``.cmd`` file as the command of an MCP "
"server is not documented by Trae and was not observed."
msgstr ""
"Windows。``install.cmd`` 和 Windows 运行脚本已用 PowerShell 测试。Trae 是否会把 ``.cmd``"
" 文件作为 MCP 服务器的命令启动，Trae 的文档未作说明，也未经观察。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:397
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:403
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:404
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:405
msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:406
msgid "The session has no anet tools."
msgstr "会话中没有 anet 工具。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:407
msgid "``anet`` is missing, or its daemon is not running."
msgstr "``anet`` 缺失，或其守护进程未运行。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:408
msgid ""
"Run ``sh ~/.trae/anet/bin/anet-run.sh status``. ``[daemon_not_running]``:"
" run ``sh ~/.trae/anet/bin/anet-run.sh up``, which applies the identity "
"and the executable of the settings. ``anet`` not found: ask the agent to "
"run the ``anet-setup`` skill. Then start a new session."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``sh ~/.trae/anet/bin/anet-run.sh status``。``[daemon_not_running]``：运行"
" ``sh ~/.trae/anet/bin/anet-run.sh up``，它会应用设置中的身份和可执行文件。找不到 ``anet``：请 "
"agent 运行技能 ``anet-setup``。然后启动新会话。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:412
msgid "``executable: invalid setting anetPath=...``"
msgstr "``executable: invalid setting anetPath=...``"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:413
msgid "The setting names a file that is not an executable."
msgstr "该设置指向的文件不是可执行文件。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:414
msgid ""
"Run ``install.sh --anet ''`` (``install.cmd -ClearAnet``) or give the "
"correct path."
msgstr "运行 ``install.sh --anet ''``\\ （``install.cmd -ClearAnet``）或给出正确的路径。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:416
msgid "The installer refuses the installation."
msgstr "安装程序拒绝安装。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:417
msgid ""
"The home directory contains a space (Linux and macOS) or has no short "
"form without one (Windows), or a skill or command of the same name exists"
" that the installer did not install."
msgstr "主目录含有空格（Linux 和 macOS），或没有不含空格的短路径（Windows），或存在并非由安装程序安装的同名技能或命令。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:420
msgid ""
"Use ``--project`` (``-Project``) with a path without spaces, or move the "
"other file."
msgstr "使用 ``--project``\\ （``-Project``）并指定不含空格的路径，或移走另一个文件。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:422
msgid "The agent reports another identity than expected."
msgstr "Agent 报告的身份与预期不同。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:423
msgid "``anet/settings`` and the ``env`` of the MCP entry differ."
msgstr "``anet/settings`` 与 MCP 条目的 ``env`` 不一致。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:424
msgid ""
"Make ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` in the entry equal to the identity in "
"``anet/settings``."
msgstr "使条目中的 ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 与 ``anet/settings`` 中的身份相同。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:426
msgid ""
"The hub reports that today's sign-ups are used up, and the registration "
"stays pending."
msgstr "hub 提示当日注册名额已用完，注册保持待处理。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:428
msgid "The hub limits sign-ups from a network."
msgstr "hub 对同一网络的注册数量设有限制。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:429
msgid "Give the line that the agent prints to the hub operator."
msgstr "把 agent 输出的那一行交给 hub 运营方。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:430
msgid "``wait_task`` ends while the task is still working."
msgstr "任务仍在进行时 ``wait_task`` 已结束。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:431
msgid "This is normal for long tasks."
msgstr "这在长时间任务中属于正常现象。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:432
msgid "Call ``wait_task`` again and do not send the task again."
msgstr "再次调用 ``wait_task``\\ ，不要重新发送任务。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:433
msgid "A refusal ends with a code in brackets."
msgstr "拒绝信息末尾带有方括号中的代码。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:435
msgid "See :doc:`../reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr "参见 :doc:`../reference/reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../agents/trae.rst:437
msgid "For other failures, see :doc:`../howto/troubleshooting`."
msgstr "其他故障参见 :doc:`../howto/troubleshooting`\\ 。"

